{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:20:53.309Z","data":{"text":"Implemented the Rust inbox worktree/archived reading.\n\nChanged:\n- Loads `osq.toml`; with `vcs.enabled` and a git root, reads all trees via `change_trees`/`list_tree_changes`.\n- Landed group now reads the root tree only.\n- Adds archived worktree items: steering first, otherwise archived-not-landed when the default branch lacks the folder and `osq/<folder>` holds the archived approval.\n- Reuses steering triggers and sorts all needs-you items by id.\n- Added `crates/features/inbox/tests/inbox_trees.rs` covering all three required scenarios, plus a stacked/root guard test.\n- Added inbox crate dependencies on `osq-kernel-config` and `osq-kernel-vcs`.\n\nVerified:\n- `cargo test -p osq-feature-inbox --test inbox_trees`\n- Targeted `cargo mutants` on every changed source file: all mutants caught or unviable.\n- `cargo fmt --all`\n- `OSQ_CHANGE=openspec/changes/270-rust-inbox-archived sh scripts/verify-rust.sh`\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/270-rust-inbox-archived/.run/results/1.md`."}}
